{"availability":"available","full":"speridlabs/iris-3b","name":"iris-3b","description":"Iris-3B: pixel-space generation & general vision learner. A 3B diffusion transformer that generates every pixel directly (no VAE); the same prior, fine-tuned, does monocular depth estimation and 4x image restoration. Paper, weights, training code and demo.","category":"Education","language":"Python","stars":83,"forks":7,"created":"2026-10-05T14:50:43Z","updated":"2026-10-08T16:51:32Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://speridlabs.com/research/iris","topics":["depth-estimation","diffusion","flow-matching","generative-prior","image-restoration","pixel-space","pytorch","super-resolution","text-to-image","vision-foundation-model"],"demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/speridlabs/iris-3b","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T08:18:50.359Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T08:18:50.359Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T08:18:50.359Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T08:18:50.359Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2108241673897877739","postId":"2108241673897877739","postedAt":"2026-10-08T17:02:38.000Z"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T08:18:50.654Z","stars":83,"forks":7}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Pixel-space generation & general vision learner","Generative priors are a promising foundation for downstream vision tasks. In this project we explore pixel-space generative models as an alternative to vision foundation models such as DINOv2.","Iris-3B is a 3B-parameter diffusion transformer that generates directly in pixel space: no VAE, no latent space, every pixel is produced by the model, so nothing is lost to a lossy, texture-biased latent. It is not only an image generator: the same pixel-space prior, fine-tuned, estimates monocular depth and restores and upscales images — one backbone, three tasks. This repository contains the model, the t